step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple robust mean combination on the full model pool to see baseline performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to test if weighting improves over the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a simple mean combination on the smaller, potentially more stable pool1 to see if reducing model set improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming outliers improves over median and mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust dba combination on the full pool to see if it improves over the current median winner.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the top performing model ONLY_DWT_rf to see if a single best model outperforms the robust combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_DWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination with inverse_error on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if a simple weighting improves over median and best_single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model weight (w1) on the full pool to see if a more sophisticated weighting improves over the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on the more diverse pool2 to see if adding the rf model improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on pool2 to see if a robust median on a slightly larger pool improves over the current best.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on pool3 to see if adding ETS improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

